message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "Photocatalysis: machine learning for g-C3N4 synthesis optimization"
abstract: >-
  Machine learning pipeline that predicts the photocatalytic hydrogen
  production efficiency of graphitic carbon nitride (g-C3N4) from its
  synthesis parameters, with hyperparameter optimization, SHAP-based feature
  importance analysis and a Streamlit web interface.
